Subject: pcsx2-gsrunner: -direct, drive MTGS from a GS dump without VMManager::Initialize

Rule of Rose port, renderer plan step 0 (notes/renderer.md 6.5): settings into EmuConfig (VMManager::ApplySettings),
MTGS::WaitForOpen, then the dump's streams fed the way GSDumpReplayer feeds them, from the CPU thread, with no VM,
BIOS, EE/IOP or SPU2. Against PCSX2 v2.8.2 (fd9d310).

